Added simple makefiles for linux, win32 and osx. Mild testing on all got done.
Copy Makefile.? to Makefile and run make/nmake.

You'll need SDL2 in ./SDL2/:
( https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL/releases/tag/release-2.32.8 )
Or this convenient fork, preconfigured to build as static library:
( https://github.com/mschilder123/SDL2.git )

For Quest3/Windows builds you also need part of the (abandoned) Oculus PC SDK:
( https://developers.meta.com/horizon/downloads/package/oculus-sdk-for-windows/ )
Symlink or copy relevant directory to ./LibOVR/

./VisualC/ contains a sln file.
